  "summary_en": "Voluntary ASEAN guide for organisations designing, developing and deploying traditional AI in non-military applications. It sets seven principles and a four-part governance framework (internal governance, risk-based human involvement, operations management, stakeholder communication). It also gives national and regional recommendations and company use cases. Autonomous vehicles appear only as passing examples.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Seven guiding principles: transparency/explainability, fairness, security/safety, human-centricity, privacy, accountability, robustness.",
   "Risk-impact assessment determines human-in/over/out-of-the-loop oversight.",
   "Organisations should set up AI ethics boards and clear roles across the AI lifecycle.",
   "Recommends national actions (talent, R&D, awareness) and a regional ASEAN Working Group on AI Governance.",
   "Voluntary; does not replace national laws; excludes military and dual-use applications."
